*PPD-Adobe: "4.3"
*% Epson SureColor SC-F100 (dye sublimation) - CUPS driver built on Epson's escpr2
*% Filter: rastertoscf100 (epson-scf100-linux). Not made by or affiliated with Epson.
*% SPDX-License-Identifier: GPL-2.0-or-later
*FormatVersion: "4.3"
*FileVersion: "0.1.0"
*LanguageVersion: English
*LanguageEncoding: ISOLatin1
*PCFileName: "SCF100SB.PPD"
*Manufacturer: "EPSON"
*Product: "(SC-F100 Series)"
*ModelName: "EPSON SC-F100 Series Sublimation"
*ShortNickName: "EPSON SC-F100 Sublimation"
*NickName: "EPSON SC-F100 Series Sublimation, epson-scf100-linux 0.1.0"
*1284DeviceID: "MFG:EPSON;CMD:ESCPL2,BDC,D4,D4PX,ESCPR7,END4,GENEP;MDL:SC-F100 Series;CLS:PRINTER;DES:EPSON SC-F100 Series;"
*PSVersion: "(3010.000) 0"
*LanguageLevel: "3"
*ColorDevice: True
*DefaultColorSpace: RGB
*FileSystem: False
*Throughput: "1"
*% CUPS default: applications rotate landscape counter-clockwise onto a portrait page.
*% rastertoscf100 compensates for this on the mug size (Okular/Qt and GIMP rotate this way).
*LandscapeOrientation: Plus90
*TTRasterizer: Type42
*cupsVersion: 2.4
*cupsModelNumber: 0
*cupsManualCopies: True
*cupsFilter2: "application/vnd.cups-raster application/vnd.epson.escpr 0 rastertoscf100"
*cupsLanguages: "de"

*% For Epson's epson-escpr-wrapper2 (escpr2): band compression and lines per band as on Windows
*ESCPRCompression: 3, 16


*OpenUI *ColorModel/Color Mode: PickOne
*OrderDependency: 10 AnySetup *ColorModel
*DefaultColorModel: RGB
*ColorModel RGB/Color: "<</cupsColorSpace 1/cupsColorOrder 0/cupsBitsPerColor 8>>setpagedevice"
*CloseUI: *ColorModel

*OpenUI *Resolution/Resolution: PickOne
*OrderDependency: 10 AnySetup *Resolution
*DefaultResolution: 600dpi
*Resolution 600dpi/600 dpi: "<</HWResolution[600 600]>>setpagedevice"
*CloseUI: *Resolution

*OpenUI *ScfMedia/Media Type: PickOne
*OrderDependency: 20 AnySetup *ScfMedia
*DefaultScfMedia: Rigid
*ScfMedia Rigid/DS Transfer General Purpose (Rigid): ""
*ScfMedia Textile/DS Transfer General Purpose (Textile): ""
*CloseUI: *ScfMedia

*OpenUI *ScfQuality/Print Quality: PickOne
*OrderDependency: 20 AnySetup *ScfQuality
*DefaultScfQuality: High
*ScfQuality High/High: ""
*ScfQuality Standard/Standard: ""
*CloseUI: *ScfQuality

*% IPP print-quality -> ScfQuality. Without these presets, some CUPS builds (e.g. Ubuntu) guess a mapping from the
*% option name and turn the default print-quality=normal into "Standard", overriding *DefaultScfQuality: High.
*APPrinterPreset Color_Draft/Draft: "*ColorModel RGB *ScfQuality Standard com.apple.print.preset.graphicsType General com.apple.print.preset.quality low com.apple.print.preset.output-mode color"
*End
*APPrinterPreset Color_Normal/Normal: "*ColorModel RGB *ScfQuality High com.apple.print.preset.graphicsType General com.apple.print.preset.quality mid com.apple.print.preset.output-mode color"
*End
*APPrinterPreset Color_High/High: "*ColorModel RGB *ScfQuality High com.apple.print.preset.graphicsType General com.apple.print.preset.quality high com.apple.print.preset.output-mode color"
*End

*OpenUI *ScfMirror/Mirror Image: Boolean
*OrderDependency: 20 AnySetup *ScfMirror
*DefaultScfMirror: True
*ScfMirror True/On: ""
*ScfMirror False/Off: ""
*CloseUI: *ScfMirror

*OpenUI *ScfColor/Color Management: PickOne
*OrderDependency: 20 AnySetup *ScfColor
*DefaultScfColor: Driver
*ScfColor Driver/Driver converts with the Epson ICC profile: ""
*ScfColor Application/None - application already converted to the Epson profile: ""
*CloseUI: *ScfColor

*OpenUI *ScfIntent/Rendering Intent: PickOne
*OrderDependency: 20 AnySetup *ScfIntent
*DefaultScfIntent: Perceptual
*ScfIntent Perceptual/Perceptual: ""
*ScfIntent Relative/Relative Colorimetric: ""
*CloseUI: *ScfIntent

*OpenUI *ScfDirection/Print Direction: PickOne
*OrderDependency: 20 AnySetup *ScfDirection
*DefaultScfDirection: Uni
*ScfDirection Uni/Unidirectional (fewer banding): ""
*ScfDirection Bi/Bidirectional (faster): ""
*CloseUI: *ScfDirection

*% Pages: 8.4 pt margins all around like the Epson drivers. The mug size is deliberately LANDSCAPE (240 x 100 mm):
*% every application then sends the design unrotated, and rastertoscf100 rotates it clockwise into the feed
*% direction like Windows. As portrait plus "landscape" in the application, GIMP rotated counter-clockwise (180 deg off).
*HWMargins: 8.4 8.4 8.4 8.4
*OpenUI *PageSize/Page Size: PickOne
*OrderDependency: 10 AnySetup *PageSize
*DefaultPageSize: 100x240mmRotated
*PageSize 100x240mmRotated/Mug (240 x 100 mm): "<</PageSize[680.31 283.46]/ImagingBBox null>>setpagedevice"
*PageSize A4/A4: "<</PageSize[595.28 841.89]/ImagingBBox null>>setpagedevice"
*PageSize Letter/US Letter: "<</PageSize[612 792]/ImagingBBox null>>setpagedevice"
*PageSize Legal/US Legal: "<</PageSize[612 1008]/ImagingBBox null>>setpagedevice"
*CloseUI: *PageSize

*OpenUI *PageRegion: PickOne
*OrderDependency: 10 AnySetup *PageRegion
*DefaultPageRegion: 100x240mmRotated
*PageRegion 100x240mmRotated/Mug (240 x 100 mm): "<</PageSize[680.31 283.46]/ImagingBBox null>>setpagedevice"
*PageRegion A4/A4: "<</PageSize[595.28 841.89]/ImagingBBox null>>setpagedevice"
*PageRegion Letter/US Letter: "<</PageSize[612 792]/ImagingBBox null>>setpagedevice"
*PageRegion Legal/US Legal: "<</PageSize[612 1008]/ImagingBBox null>>setpagedevice"
*CloseUI: *PageRegion

*DefaultImageableArea: 100x240mmRotated
*ImageableArea 100x240mmRotated/Mug (240 x 100 mm): "8.4 8.4 671.91 275.06"
*ImageableArea A4/A4: "8.4 8.4 586.88 833.49"
*ImageableArea Letter/US Letter: "8.4 8.4 603.6 783.6"
*ImageableArea Legal/US Legal: "8.4 8.4 603.6 999.6"

*DefaultPaperDimension: 100x240mmRotated
*PaperDimension 100x240mmRotated/Mug (240 x 100 mm): "680.31 283.46"
*PaperDimension A4/A4: "595.28 841.89"
*PaperDimension Letter/US Letter: "612 792"
*PaperDimension Legal/US Legal: "612 1008"

*% Custom sizes: per the Mac driver width 144-612.2 pt, length 243.6-3402 pt. The upper limits here are 18 pt
*% higher because escpr2 also checks them for its internally enlarged page (+140 dots). rastertoscf100 rejects
*% real overruns with a message.
*VariablePaperSize: True
*MaxMediaWidth: "630.2"
*MaxMediaHeight: "3420"
*CustomPageSize True: "pop pop pop <</PageSize[5 -2 roll]/ImagingBBox null>>setpagedevice"
*ParamCustomPageSize Width: 1 points 144 630.2
*ParamCustomPageSize Height: 2 points 243.6 3420
*ParamCustomPageSize WidthOffset: 3 points 0 0
*ParamCustomPageSize HeightOffset: 4 points 0 0
*ParamCustomPageSize Orientation: 5 int 0 0

*% German user interface
*de.Translation Manufacturer/EPSON: ""
*de.Translation ScfMedia/Medium: ""
*de.ScfMedia Rigid/DS Transfer General Purpose (Rigid, Tassen/Hartwaren): ""
*de.Translation ScfQuality/Druckqualitaet: ""
*de.ScfMedia Textile/DS Transfer General Purpose (Textile, Stoffe): ""
*de.ScfQuality High/Stark: ""
*de.ScfQuality Standard/Standard: ""
*de.Translation ScfMirror/Bild spiegeln: ""
*de.ScfMirror True/An: ""
*de.ScfMirror False/Aus: ""
*de.Translation ScfColor/Farbverwaltung: ""
*de.ScfColor Driver/Treiber rechnet mit dem Epson-ICC-Profil um: ""
*de.ScfColor Application/Keine - Programm hat schon ins Epson-Profil umgerechnet: ""
*de.Translation ScfIntent/Renderpriorität: ""
*de.ScfIntent Perceptual/Wahrnehmungsorientiert: ""
*de.ScfIntent Relative/Relativ farbmetrisch: ""
*de.Translation ScfDirection/Druckrichtung: ""
*de.ScfDirection Uni/Nur eine Richtung (weniger Streifen): ""
*de.ScfDirection Bi/Beide Richtungen (schneller): ""
*de.Translation PageSize/Papierformat: ""
*de.PageSize 100x240mmRotated/Tasse (240 x 100 mm): ""
*de.Translation ColorModel/Farbmodus: ""
*de.ColorModel RGB/Farbe: ""
*de.Translation Resolution/Auflösung: ""
*de.PageSize A4/A4: ""
*de.PageSize Letter/US Letter: ""
*de.PageSize Legal/US Legal: ""
*de.Resolution 600dpi/600 dpi: ""
